## 2. The 3-Layer Evaluation Architecture

```mermaid
graph TD
    A[Student Audio & Speech Stream] --> B[Layer 1: Lexical Recognition]
    A --> C[Layer 2: Phoneme Accuracy]
    A --> D[Layer 3: Blending / Temporal Fluency]

    B -->|ASR Identified Word| E{Evaluate Evidence}
    C -->|Detected Phoneme Sequence| E
    D -->|Continuous vs Segmented Timing| E

    E -->|Evidence: TRANSCRIPT_ONLY| F[Status: LEXICAL_MATCH_ONLY<br>Mastery: FALSE<br>Prompts Smooth Blending]
    E -->|Evidence: ACOUSTIC_VERIFIED + Fluent| G[Status: CORRECT_FLUENT<br>Mastery: TRUE]
    E -->|Evidence: Segmented / Paused| H[Status: CORRECT_NEEDS_SMOOTHING<br>Mastery: FALSE<br>Corrective Modeling]
    E -->|Evidence: Miscue / Wrong Sound| I[Status: PHONEME_SUBSTITUTION / DELETION<br>Mastery: FALSE]
```

